### Login as a gallery
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "gallery@t.co", "password": "Password1234!", "userRole": "gallery" }

> {% client.global.set("galleryAccessToken", response.body.data.token.accessToken); %}

### List art works scoped to the caller (optionally ?status=available|on_loan|sold|returned)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artworks
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryAccessToken}}

### List only available art works
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artworks?status=available
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryAccessToken}}

### Read a single art work
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artworks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryAccessToken}}

### Update an art work (owning artist, owning gallery, or admin)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artworks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sellingPrice": 2500, "description": "Updated description" }

### Change an art work status (owning gallery or admin, tracked in history)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artworks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "on_loan" }

### Delete an art work (blocked when sold, on loan, or in an exposition)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/artworks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryAccessToken}}
